 * Values mirror `components/colors.ts` and `components/zLayers.ts` exactly;
 * `colors.test.ts` enforces the match. Tailwind utilities
 * (`text-om-text-primary`, `bg-om-bg-app`, `shadow-om-sm`, `z-om-modal`, …)
 * resolve to these vars via `tailwind.config.cjs`.
 *
 * The `om-` prefix keeps every utility distinct from CDS's own vocabulary
 * (`text-primary`, `shadow-sm`, …), which must keep resolving to `--cds-*`
 * for the CDS components already in use.
